(206, 2, '2013-08-31 03:33:34', '2013-08-31 03:33:34', '<h3>The Winter Solstice Kickstarter</h3>\nFor the past couple years, we\'ve been running small meetups, holidays, and community events. This winter, on December 14th, we\'re getting ready to launch our first major event - the Winter Solstice celebration, in New York City. We\'re hoping to to have hundreds of people participate in a musical, holiday ceremony.\n\nWe\'ve spoken with the people at Ethical Culture - one of the oldest humanist institutions. They have a beautiful building with several different spaces we might use, depending on how many people are coming and how many people are willing to pledge money in advance.\n\nWe\'re hoping to raise enough money to reserve their auditorium:\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-429\" src=\"http://secularsolstice.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/09/fullaudience.jpg\" alt=\"fullaudience\" width=\"950\" height=\"633\" />\n<h4>September 14th, we\'re launching a kickstarter to determine the size and scope of the event.</h4>\nKickstarter is a crowdfunding website - it allows artists to announce a project, which people can pledge money to. If enough people pledge enough money, the project is funded, the artist creates something awesome, and the people who helped fund it get to participate in an experience that they helped create. If the money isn\'t raised, the project doesn\'t happen.\n\nIf you\'ve  been longing for a powerful, cultural experience within a scientific, rational worldview, get ready to pledge money on the opening day, to kick off this kickstarter with a bang! If you donate at least $25, you\'ll get a ticket to the event (ticket prices at the door will be $35).\n\nIf you won\'t be able to attend yourself, consider pledging just $5 - and then let us know who you are and where you\'re from in the comments. If enough people are interested in your area, you can put together a smaller, local event. And if enough people in your region are interested, in followup years we may run an event there.', 'Kickstarter', '', 'private', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'kickstarter', '', '', '2013-08-31 03:33:34', '2013-08-31 03:33:34', '', 0, 'http://humanistculture.wordpress.com/?page_id=206', 0, 'page', '', 0),
