(1657, 2, '2016-09-27 23:21:58', '2016-09-27 23:21:58', 'Humanist Culture is run by Raymond Arnold, a community organizer and ritual designer from New York City. He helps run the New York Rationality community as well as Sunday Assembly NY.\r\n\r\nIf you\'d like to get in touch or arrange a skype, send an email to humanistculture@gmail.com.', 'Contact', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1163-revision-v1', '', '', '2016-09-27 23:21:58', '2016-09-27 23:21:58', '', 1163, 'http://secularsolstice.com/1163-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
