lue=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;19 - Uplift&quot;}\">19 - Uplift</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:6}\">6</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:15}\">15</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:19}\">19</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:33}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">33</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;01 - Bright Side of Life&quot;}\">01 - Always Look on the Bright Side of Life</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:2}\">2</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:8}\">8</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:25}\">25</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:12}\">12</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:35}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">35</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;20 - Five Thousand Years&quot;}\">20 - Five Thousand Years</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:3}\">3</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:4}\">4</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:27}\">27</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:11}\">11</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:35}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">35</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;05 - When I Die&quot;}\">05 - When I Die</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:9}\">9</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:17}\">17</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:20}\">20</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:36}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">36</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;15 - Brighter Than Today&quot;}\">15 - Brighter Than Today</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:4}\">4</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:14}\">14</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:24}\">24</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:36}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">36</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;18 - Here Comes the Sun&quot;}\">18 - Here Comes the Sun</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:0}\">0</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:7}\">7</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:27}\">27</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:10}\">10</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:37}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">37</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;08 - Time Wrote the Rocks&quot;}\">08 - Time Wrote the Rocks</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:3}\">3</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:22}\">22</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:21}\">21</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:41}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5])\">41</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Weighted Score</h2>\r\nIt seems like \"Love\" should count for more than a \"Like.\" How much more? I asked Jacob Falkovich, who runs a blog on putting <a href=\"https://putanumonit.com/\">numbers on arbitrary things</a> for his advice, and he suggested:\r\n\r\n<em>\"If you\'re looking for \"the best\", I would make the weighting convex, i.e. Love+Meh &gt; Like+Like. A couple reasons:</em>\r\n<em>1. The scale is bounded, so someone who feels \"this is my favorite song ever\" can\'t go higher than 5.</em>\r\n<em>2. Songs with high variance are more memorable and exciting, like profiles that get high variance on OKCupid. I think the \"best\" song should be one that stands out, not a milquetoast compromise.\"</em>\r\n\r\nSo I decided to weigh Loves at 2.25, Likes at 1, \"Ehs\" at 0, Dislikes at -1, Hateds at -2.25. When doing that, the outcome is:\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}--></style>\r\n<table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"height: 661px;\" border=\"1\" width=\"596\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup> <col width=\"177\" /> <col width=\"44\" /> <col width=\"51\" /> <col width=\"34\" /> <col width=\"37\" /> <col width=\"46\" /> <col width=\"78\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Name&quot;}\">Name</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Hate&quot;}\">Hate</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Dislike&quot;}\">Dislike</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Eh&quot;}\">Eh</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Like&quot;}\">Like</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Love&quot;}\">Love</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Weighted&quot;}\">Weighted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;04 - Gather Round&quot;}\">04 - Gather Round</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1}\">1</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:4}\">4</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:18}\">18</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:15}\">15</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:6}\">6</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:22.25}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=Sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]*2.25-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5]*2.25)\">22.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;11 - Blowin in the Wind&quot;}\">11 - Blowin\' in the Wind</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:2}\">2</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:5}\">5</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:11}\">11</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:18}\">18</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:7}\">7</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:24.25}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=Sum(R[0]C[-2]+R[0]C[-1]*2.25-R[0]C[-4]-R[0]C[-5]*2.25)\">24.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;03 - Bring the Light&quot;}\">03 - Bring the Light</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:2}\">2</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:2}\">2</td>\r\n<td data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:15}\">15<